,"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A rule a property’s value must satisfy, as one of JSON Schema’s validation keywords (draft"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"2020-12): a bound on a string’s length, on a number, or on an array’s count, or a pattern a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"string matches."}]}}}